@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Refunds and Cancellations";
}
<article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 text-ink leading-relaxed">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-700 mb-2">Refunds and Cancellations</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted mb-8">Prototype information. No online checkout, payment collection or order placement is implemented in this project.</p>
    <p>Because this site currently collects quote enquiries only, it does not take payment and there is no website refund transaction to process. Before accepting paid orders, the business must publish its confirmed cancellation, deposit, refund, faulty-goods and custom-made-goods terms, consistent with applicable consumer law.</p>
    <p class="mt-5">For an existing order or payment enquiry, contact <a class="underline text-brand-700" href="mailto:info@woodlandsdb.co.za">info@woodlandsdb.co.za</a>. Confirm this address before launch.</p>
</article>